WEBVTT

00:00:00.580 --> 00:00:06.050
Jack, Luca, Lua, Aki, Crow.

00:00:08.840 --> 00:00:10.810
Your thoughts are with me.

00:00:10.810 --> 00:00:13.220
I will win for our future!

00:00:20.710 --> 00:00:21.830
Duel Mode on.

00:00:24.290 --> 00:00:25.080
Duel!

00:00:26.130 --> 00:00:28.890
I Special Summon Time Maiden.

00:00:33.160 --> 00:00:37.920
I can Special Summon it when 
there are no cards on my field.

00:00:37.920 --> 00:00:41.540
When I Tribute Summon
a Fairy-Type monster,

00:00:41.540 --> 00:00:44.890
this card counts as two monsters.

00:00:44.890 --> 00:00:45.860
What?

00:00:46.450 --> 00:00:52.560
I tribute Time Maiden to 
summon Metaion, the Timelord.

00:00:56.280 --> 00:00:57.130
There it is.

00:00:58.340 --> 00:01:01.450
I set one card and end my turn.

00:01:02.200 --> 00:01:04.570
Now it's your turn.

00:01:05.170 --> 00:01:11.250
If you really have the power to 
change the future, then defeat me.

00:01:12.580 --> 00:01:15.020
If I don't hurry, our city 
will be destroyed.

00:01:24.900 --> 00:01:26.530
Yusei is dueling?

00:01:31.600 --> 00:01:33.040
Everyone, don't stop!

00:01:33.490 --> 00:01:35.230
Please don't turn around!

00:01:35.230 --> 00:01:36.480
It's dangerous here!

00:01:36.480 --> 00:01:38.010
Please get to safety immediately!

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:42.860
Whoa!

00:01:43.430 --> 00:01:44.940
I'm sorry.

00:01:50.680 --> 00:01:58.020
Z-one, for the future of Neo Domino City, 
I will win this duel and stop Ark Cradle!

00:02:01.360 --> 00:02:02.460
My turn!

00:02:04.660 --> 00:02:10.040
I can Special Summon this card when  
you're the only one who has monsters.

00:02:10.040 --> 00:02:12.460
I Special Summon Double Delta Warrior!

00:02:15.800 --> 00:02:21.820
I discard two cards from my hand to Special
Summon the Tuner Monster Big Eater!

00:02:25.410 --> 00:02:31.240
When I have a Tuner, I can Special Summon
Quillbolt Hedgehog from my graveyard!

00:02:34.720 --> 00:02:38.090
Next, I summon Debris Dragon!

00:02:42.930 --> 00:02:46.890
When Debris Dragon is summoned, 
I can negate the effects of a monster

00:02:46.890 --> 00:02:50.280
in my graveyard with 500 or fewer 
attack points and Special Summon it!

00:02:50.690 --> 00:02:54.510
I Special Summon Clear Effector from 
my graveyard with 0 attack points!

00:02:58.720 --> 00:03:00.420
Incredible, Yusei!

00:03:01.220 --> 00:03:04.120
He instantly summoned five monsters.

00:03:04.450 --> 00:03:07.890
He filled his Monster Zone 
with a one turn combo.

00:03:08.250 --> 00:03:12.150
Yusei is going all out from the start.

00:03:12.930 --> 00:03:18.410
Level 2 Big Eater tunes Level 
6 Double Delta Warrior!

00:03:19.040 --> 00:03:21.140
Everyone gave me their power.

00:03:21.140 --> 00:03:24.550
I will use the power of 
our bond known as Synchro!

00:03:27.590 --> 00:03:28.760
Go, Yusei!

00:03:28.760 --> 00:03:30.480
This is our bond!

00:03:30.800 --> 00:03:31.980
Black whirlwind...

00:03:32.300 --> 00:03:35.880
Your secret thoughts
appear on your wings!

00:03:35.880 --> 00:03:37.340
Synchro Summon!

00:03:37.920 --> 00:03:40.830
Take flight, Black-Winged Dragon!

00:03:46.660 --> 00:03:51.690
Then Level 4 Debris Dragon tunes 
Level 2 Quillbolt Hedgehog

00:03:51.690 --> 00:03:54.090
and Level 2 Clear Effector!

00:03:57.720 --> 00:04:00.910
Yusei, use my rugged soul!

00:04:01.350 --> 00:04:02.410
The pulse of the King...

00:04:02.820 --> 00:04:04.700
Now forms a line here!

00:04:04.700 --> 00:04:07.280
Witness the power of
the rumbling heavens!

00:04:07.280 --> 00:04:08.900
Synchro Summon!

00:04:09.820 --> 00:04:11.100
My soul!

00:04:11.100 --> 00:04:12.790
Red Dragon Archfiend!

00:04:21.440 --> 00:04:24.770
He summoned two Synchro 
Monsters in one turn.

00:04:24.770 --> 00:04:26.810
Go, Yusei!

00:04:26.810 --> 00:04:28.470
Use our power!

00:04:31.270 --> 00:04:31.990
Z-one...

00:04:32.900 --> 00:04:36.970
I will travel the path I believe in
and strike you with everything I have!

00:04:37.840 --> 00:04:39.210
And I will win!

00:04:41.780 --> 00:04:43.670
Riding Duels.

00:04:43.670 --> 00:04:46.740
These duels evolved in the world of speed.

00:04:46.740 --> 00:04:53.320
The people with the legendary marks who 
risked their lives were known as 5D's.

00:04:55.240 --> 00:05:01.340
Run! The road of evolution leading to tomorrow

00:05:01.340 --> 00:05:05.880
Is a new legendary duel

00:05:17.850 --> 00:05:22.840
Throw away all feelings of failure

00:05:23.360 --> 00:05:28.460
Set free your infinite potential

00:05:28.460 --> 00:05:34.070
Every beginning is up to you

00:05:34.070 --> 00:05:40.680
Everyone is lost Pursue the light

00:05:40.680 --> 00:05:45.980
Losing sight of fleeting dreams

00:05:45.980 --> 00:05:51.550
Connect the bond and you'll never lose

00:05:53.520 --> 00:05:59.400
Become the gale and dance Cut through the darkness

00:05:59.400 --> 00:06:04.600
Even if you can't see your destination

00:06:04.600 --> 00:06:10.070
Run on your feet without fear

00:06:10.390 --> 00:06:15.940
On this road that leads to tomorrow

00:06:15.940 --> 00:06:23.470
Going my way!! Break through and go!

00:06:36.930 --> 00:06:42.500
Betting on Victory with Just One Card

00:06:46.160 --> 00:06:47.740
Wow.

00:06:48.100 --> 00:06:49.770
What's happening?

00:06:50.610 --> 00:06:51.480
What?

00:06:51.990 --> 00:06:53.950
You're behind on 
evacuating the citizens?

00:06:54.200 --> 00:06:57.770
Everyone's watching Yusei duel.
There's nothing we can do.

00:06:58.960 --> 00:07:01.920
Can't you urge them to evacuate?

00:07:02.160 --> 00:07:03.880
I will help!

00:07:09.350 --> 00:07:11.030
You're...

00:07:16.420 --> 00:07:17.820
Thank you, Mister.

00:07:18.480 --> 00:07:20.710
Everyone in Neo Domino City!

00:07:22.870 --> 00:07:28.850
Yusei Fudo is battling Z-one 
to protect this city and us!

00:07:29.190 --> 00:07:33.990
Don't let his efforts go to waste!
Don't stand still!

00:07:34.640 --> 00:07:40.410
I will be your eyes and ears 
and report the progress of this duel!

00:07:41.910 --> 00:07:45.730
So don't turn around and 
evacuate to a safe place!

00:07:46.080 --> 00:07:47.210
Hey, let's go.

00:07:47.210 --> 00:07:48.400
You're right. Let's hurry!

00:07:49.280 --> 00:07:53.530
How will Yusei Fudo
 use Black-Winged Dragon

00:07:53.530 --> 00:07:57.650
and Red Dragon Archfiend to attack?

00:07:57.650 --> 00:07:58.870
That guy...

00:07:59.240 --> 00:08:01.080
You're fine doing this?

00:08:01.640 --> 00:08:03.480
This is a dangerous place.

00:08:03.480 --> 00:08:04.670
If you don't hurry up and leave-

00:08:04.670 --> 00:08:06.700
Leave?  Of course not!

00:08:06.700 --> 00:08:09.550
There's an incredible duel 
taking place before my eyes!

00:08:09.550 --> 00:08:12.820
If I don't report it, who will?

00:08:15.810 --> 00:08:20.230
Like I thought, the Crimson 
Dragon's minions appeared.

00:08:20.230 --> 00:08:25.230
But no matter how many powerful 
Synchro Monsters you summon,

00:08:25.230 --> 00:08:27.910
the situation doesn't change.

00:08:28.270 --> 00:08:33.630
Metaion, the Timelord can't be destroyed 
in battle, and he doesn't take damage.

00:08:33.630 --> 00:08:38.940
And if it battles, every monster it 
battles returns to the hand.

00:08:38.940 --> 00:08:42.680
And Yusei takes 300 points of  
damage for every monster.

00:08:43.570 --> 00:08:47.450
Even if Yusei attacks
Metaion, that effect

00:08:47.450 --> 00:08:51.190
won't let him deal damage, 
and he also takes damage himself.

00:08:51.460 --> 00:08:52.970
What is he going to do?

00:08:53.280 --> 00:08:57.680
If my Red Dragon Archfiend doesn't 
attack, its effect destroys

00:08:57.680 --> 00:09:01.400
all his other monsters 
during the End Phase.

00:09:01.690 --> 00:09:06.560
If he doesn't battle, then my precious 
Black-Winged Dragon will go to waste.

00:09:06.560 --> 00:09:07.840
That must mean...

00:09:07.840 --> 00:09:09.110
He has a plan!

00:09:10.800 --> 00:09:13.160
As long as I have Metaion, the Timelord,

00:09:13.160 --> 00:09:17.820
no matter how powerful your Synchro 
Monster, it's pointless to battle against it.

00:09:18.280 --> 00:09:20.620
You think I don't know that?

00:09:20.960 --> 00:09:25.050
Besides, since I used Double 
Delta Warrior as Synchro Material,

00:09:25.050 --> 00:09:26.950
I'm not allowed to battle this turn.

00:09:28.830 --> 00:09:32.430
And when a Synchro Monster 
uses Clear Effector as Synchro Material,

00:09:32.430 --> 00:09:34.920
its effects are negated.

00:09:34.920 --> 00:09:38.300
So Red Dragon Archfiend's 
effects are negated.

00:09:38.300 --> 00:09:40.510
That means even if
I don't battle this turn,

00:09:40.510 --> 00:09:43.580
Black-Winged Dragon remains on my field.

00:09:44.110 --> 00:09:44.780
I knew it!

00:09:45.040 --> 00:09:46.480
Well done, Yusei!

00:09:46.820 --> 00:09:52.450
When Clear Effector is used to Synchro 
Summon, I draw one card from my deck!

00:09:54.050 --> 00:09:56.620
I set two cards and end my turn.

00:09:56.620 --> 00:10:00.970
Whoa! All he did was 
set a card this turn!

00:10:00.970 --> 00:10:05.360
Even Yusei Fudo can't attack carelessly?

00:10:05.360 --> 00:10:07.770
But it won't end like this!

00:10:08.090 --> 00:10:12.340
Win with your two Synchro Monsters!

00:10:14.760 --> 00:10:19.310
Yusei, you really couldn't attack me?

00:10:19.650 --> 00:10:20.280
What?

00:10:20.500 --> 00:10:24.980
I think you didn't want to 
attack me from the start.

00:10:26.340 --> 00:10:27.150
What?

00:10:27.150 --> 00:10:29.230
He wasn't planning to attack?

00:10:29.230 --> 00:10:30.700
What does he mean?

00:10:30.700 --> 00:10:34.490
I don't know, but Yusei definitely 
must be up to something.

00:10:34.880 --> 00:10:36.520
My turn.

00:10:37.600 --> 00:10:42.220
Metaion, the Timelord returns to 
my deck during my Standby Phase.

00:10:44.720 --> 00:10:48.370
Yusei Fudo, this is what 
you were aiming for.

00:10:49.540 --> 00:10:52.840
I bet you think you know
Timelord's characteristics.

00:10:53.620 --> 00:11:00.050
That like Metaion, you think all Timelords
 return to the deck during the Standby Phase.

00:11:00.530 --> 00:11:02.020
Yeah, exactly!

00:11:03.480 --> 00:11:05.990
You are correct.

00:11:06.660 --> 00:11:09.460
Why are you revealing  
Timelords' effects to me?

00:11:09.970 --> 00:11:13.980
Because even if I reveal 
it, I have nothing to fear.

00:11:13.980 --> 00:11:14.660
What?

00:11:15.120 --> 00:11:18.380
You're not going to attack.

00:11:18.380 --> 00:11:22.820
You'll keep waiting for the summoned 
Timelords to return to my deck.

00:11:23.200 --> 00:11:29.660
You're hoping that there will be a turn 
when I don't have a Timelord in my hand.

00:11:29.970 --> 00:11:33.610
If that happens, my field will be empty.

00:11:33.610 --> 00:11:35.830
That's what you're aiming for.

00:11:36.500 --> 00:11:41.890
Do you think you can survive that  
many turns until that happens?

00:11:42.680 --> 00:11:43.610
That's right!

00:11:43.920 --> 00:11:48.860
And when it happens, I will attack you
because you'll be defenseless!

00:11:50.130 --> 00:11:55.100
Just like you, I used
to believe in possibilities.

00:11:55.100 --> 00:11:58.840
That's why I tested various 
methods for saving this world.

00:11:58.840 --> 00:12:03.230
But they all failed and didn't work.

00:12:03.230 --> 00:12:05.310
That is destiny.

00:12:05.760 --> 00:12:07.280
I'm different than you!

00:12:09.010 --> 00:12:13.930
No matter how many turns I have to wait,
 I won't give up as long as I have a chance!

00:12:14.290 --> 00:12:20.690
In order to open the future with my own hands, 
I'll believe in the tiniest possibilities!

00:12:21.030 --> 00:12:22.920
What a crazy strategy!

00:12:22.920 --> 00:12:26.650
Keep surviving Timelords' attacks?

00:12:26.650 --> 00:12:28.430
That's something I can't do.

00:12:28.840 --> 00:12:30.670
No matter the situation,

00:12:30.670 --> 00:12:34.070
he'll suffer hardship in order 
to get a chance at victory.

00:12:34.820 --> 00:12:36.920
That's what Yusei always does.

00:12:36.920 --> 00:12:37.640
Right?

00:12:39.720 --> 00:12:41.960
Let's believe in Yusei.

00:12:44.240 --> 00:12:46.040
Believe in what's possible?

00:12:46.040 --> 00:12:47.090
How foolish.

00:12:47.620 --> 00:12:51.560
Didn't you learn anything 
from Aporia's defeat?

00:12:51.990 --> 00:12:52.560
What?

00:12:52.770 --> 00:12:56.570
I activate the Continuous 
Trap Nonexistence.

00:12:57.840 --> 00:13:01.260
When there's no monster on my field,

00:13:01.260 --> 00:13:05.130
I can summon a Level 10-or-above  
monster without tribute.

00:13:06.200 --> 00:13:09.220
However, that monster's 
attack points become 0.

00:13:09.770 --> 00:13:12.800
I summon Lazion, the Timelord.

00:13:16.450 --> 00:13:20.880
Lazion, the Timelord can't be destroyed, 
and battle damage becomes 0.

00:13:20.880 --> 00:13:22.690
And when it battles,

00:13:22.690 --> 00:13:27.980
all monsters on your field and cards in your 
graveyard are shuffled into your deck.

00:13:28.400 --> 00:13:32.660
And when you draw, you take 
1000 points of damage.

00:13:33.190 --> 00:13:36.130
That's the Timelord that defeated Aporia.

00:13:36.480 --> 00:13:41.390
Yusei Fudo, you don't have 
even the tiniest hope.

00:13:41.940 --> 00:13:44.340
Kneel before the power of a god.

00:13:45.030 --> 00:13:48.880
Lazion, the Timelord attacks 
Red Dragon Archfiend.

00:13:48.880 --> 00:13:49.710
This is bad!

00:13:50.150 --> 00:13:52.980
If this succeeds, all his 
monsters return to his deck!

00:13:53.330 --> 00:13:54.180
Yusei!

00:13:54.760 --> 00:13:58.150
I flip over my trap card
Scrap-Iron Scarecrow!

00:13:58.450 --> 00:14:03.940
This card activates when you attack!
It negates your monster's attack!

00:14:06.850 --> 00:14:10.360
After it activates, this card 
is once again set!

00:14:10.700 --> 00:14:12.240
Whoa!

00:14:12.240 --> 00:14:14.440
An unexpected Scrap-Iron Scarecrow!

00:14:15.090 --> 00:14:19.410
He stopped Z-one's attack   
and negated Timelord's effect!

00:14:20.070 --> 00:14:21.440
Nice idea, Yusei.

00:14:21.750 --> 00:14:27.130
No matter how powerful Timelord's
effect is, it activates after battle.

00:14:27.130 --> 00:14:32.140
So if you negate the battle itself, 
then that effect doesn't activate!

00:14:32.140 --> 00:14:33.520
Impressive, Yusei!

00:14:34.130 --> 00:14:38.060
Z-one, no matter how many times 
you attack, I won't fall!

00:14:39.140 --> 00:14:42.760
We will open our destiny with our own hands!

00:14:52.290 --> 00:14:57.010
Do you really think that you can 
win by just defending?

00:14:58.550 --> 00:15:01.220
I set one card and end my turn.

00:15:05.080 --> 00:15:07.520
He managed to survive Timelord's attack.

00:15:07.810 --> 00:15:13.490
But if he keeps waiting, Z-one will find
a way to destroy Scrap-Iron Scarecrow.

00:15:13.920 --> 00:15:14.460
That's right!

00:15:15.040 --> 00:15:19.360
Yusei must find a way  
to win before that!

00:15:19.700 --> 00:15:21.060
My turn!

00:15:23.560 --> 00:15:24.200
All right!

00:15:24.200 --> 00:15:26.880
I activate Lazion, the 
Timelord's effect.

00:15:26.880 --> 00:15:31.380
When you draw during the Draw Phase, 
you take 1000 points of damage.

00:15:42.040 --> 00:15:43.220
Yusei!

00:15:55.320 --> 00:15:58.470
I activate Speed Spell - Angel Baton!

00:15:59.170 --> 00:16:01.610
When I have 2 or more Speed Counters,

00:16:01.610 --> 00:16:05.840
I draw two cards from my deck and send 
one card in my hand to the graveyard!

00:16:07.120 --> 00:16:07.780
I draw!

00:16:10.580 --> 00:16:11.480
This is...

00:16:22.760 --> 00:16:24.080
I see it!

00:16:24.080 --> 00:16:27.910
Even the nearly-invincible 
Timelord has a weakness!

00:16:28.790 --> 00:16:33.220
Due to Angel Baton's effect, I send 
Regen Warrior to the graveyard!

00:16:34.120 --> 00:16:39.740
When Regen Warrior is sent from my hand 
to the graveyard, it's Special Summoned!

00:16:40.070 --> 00:16:42.440
Return, Regen Warrior!

00:16:46.580 --> 00:16:49.620
I summon the Tuner 
Monster Junk Synchron!

00:16:54.930 --> 00:16:59.620
Level 3 Junk Synchron tunes 
Level 4 Regen Warrior!

00:17:02.660 --> 00:17:05.340
Yusei, let's fight together.

00:17:05.880 --> 00:17:06.840
The cold flame...

00:17:07.300 --> 00:17:09.470
Envelops the entire world!

00:17:09.470 --> 00:17:11.770
Black flower, bloom!

00:17:11.770 --> 00:17:13.070
Synchro Summon!

00:17:14.280 --> 00:17:16.750
Appear, Black Rose Dragon!

00:17:20.900 --> 00:17:25.100
Whoa! There are now three dragons!

00:17:26.130 --> 00:17:29.800
Who could have expected this?

00:17:29.800 --> 00:17:31.770
Go, Yusei Fudo!

00:17:31.770 --> 00:17:36.630
We believe that you will defeat Z-one!

00:17:36.630 --> 00:17:37.760
Wow!

00:17:37.760 --> 00:17:38.970
Incredible, Yusei!

00:17:38.970 --> 00:17:41.040
I've never seen anything like this!

00:17:41.040 --> 00:17:43.960
I activate Black Rose 
Dragon's effect!

00:17:45.010 --> 00:17:49.980
When it's Synchro Summoned,
all cards on the field are destroyed!

00:17:50.320 --> 00:17:51.310
What?

00:17:51.310 --> 00:17:53.720
Go, Black Rose Gale!

00:17:57.030 --> 00:17:58.750
Yusei, that effect will...

00:18:01.160 --> 00:18:04.690
Why is he destroying all his own monsters?

00:18:10.580 --> 00:18:13.340
Lazion, the Timelord isn't destroyed.

00:18:13.340 --> 00:18:19.510
But all your monsters and its protector 
Scrap-Iron Scarecrow are gone.

00:18:20.470 --> 00:18:23.110
Your situation is getting worse.

00:18:23.540 --> 00:18:24.580
Are you sure about that?

00:18:24.840 --> 00:18:25.780
What?

00:18:26.150 --> 00:18:29.900
Don't underestimate the power
 of our Synchro Monsters!

00:18:30.250 --> 00:18:32.850
I flip over my trap card!

00:18:33.250 --> 00:18:34.990
Synchro Barrier Force!

00:18:35.560 --> 00:18:39.190
This card negates an effect that 
would destroy cards on the field!

00:18:47.330 --> 00:18:53.310
And for every Synchro Monster on my field, 
you take 500 points of damage!

00:18:55.270 --> 00:19:01.000
Black-Winged Dragon, Red Dragon Archfiend 
and Black Rose Dragon are on my field.

00:19:01.000 --> 00:19:04.210
My friends gave me these
 three Synchro Monsters!

00:19:04.210 --> 00:19:05.250
Yusei!

00:19:05.990 --> 00:19:08.260
This is the power of the
bond with my friends!

00:19:08.260 --> 00:19:12.420
Take 1500 points of damage, Z-one!

00:19:38.000 --> 00:19:39.220
I end my turn!

00:19:40.190 --> 00:19:41.920
It worked!

00:19:41.920 --> 00:19:44.480
We thought Timelords were invincible,

00:19:44.480 --> 00:19:49.160
but Yusei Fudo dealt
Z-one a powerful blow!

00:19:49.430 --> 00:19:50.630
All right!

00:19:55.590 --> 00:19:58.740
He dealt 1500 points of damage to Z-one!

00:19:59.030 --> 00:20:00.470
Incredible, Yusei!

00:20:00.900 --> 00:20:07.440
Yusei was able to deal damage because he
believes in Synchro Monsters and our bond.

00:20:07.860 --> 00:20:10.910
Everyone, Yusei will definitely win, right?

00:20:11.320 --> 00:20:12.880
He can beat Z-one!

00:20:13.410 --> 00:20:16.350
Yes. Trust Yusei.

00:20:16.770 --> 00:20:18.760
We're counting on you, Yusei!

00:20:18.760 --> 00:20:22.330
We believe that you'll save this city!

00:20:22.880 --> 00:20:23.760
Yusei!

00:20:23.760 --> 00:20:24.790
Do your best, Yusei!

00:20:25.060 --> 00:20:25.720
Yusei!

00:20:25.720 --> 00:20:27.260
Go, Yusei!

00:20:27.260 --> 00:20:28.250
Yusei!

00:20:28.250 --> 00:20:29.040
Hang in there!

00:20:29.040 --> 00:20:30.340
We're with you!

00:20:30.340 --> 00:20:39.790
Yusei!

00:20:39.790 --> 00:20:43.000
I can hear everyone cheering!

00:20:43.000 --> 00:20:45.950
Their voices burn with hope!

00:20:45.950 --> 00:20:52.150
Yusei Fudo, you are Neo Domino City's savior!

00:20:56.710 --> 00:20:58.630
Savior?

00:20:59.010 --> 00:21:05.370
Yusei Fudo, you gave the people
hope many times before.

00:21:05.700 --> 00:21:06.900
What do you mean?

00:21:07.650 --> 00:21:15.810
Even in my future, your heroic tale was 
passed down from generation to generation.

00:21:16.310 --> 00:21:19.010
My heroic tale?

00:21:30.690 --> 00:21:31.730
What?

00:21:34.050 --> 00:21:35.200
You're...

00:21:38.420 --> 00:21:41.100
He's the same as Yusei?

00:21:41.540 --> 00:21:44.900
Z-one, who are you?

00:22:05.860 --> 00:22:11.000
If the world is endless, prove it to my heart

00:22:11.230 --> 00:22:16.370
If we shed the same tears, let's laugh together

00:22:16.370 --> 00:22:21.740
Freed reality forms phrases in the piercing beat

00:22:21.740 --> 00:22:24.510
Our hearts resonate

00:22:24.510 --> 00:22:29.720
As the nameless flower blooms with sound

00:22:29.720 --> 00:22:36.320
We'll find a place for us

00:22:38.190 --> 00:22:43.430
Waking in a dream Stretch our hands toward the future

00:22:43.430 --> 00:22:48.470
Grab and release repeatedly as we search

00:22:48.930 --> 00:22:54.640
Repaint the darkness with the colors we envision

00:22:54.640 --> 00:23:02.950
Overlaying memories, bonds and hope creates future color

00:23:02.950 --> 00:23:08.820
We will draw it forever
